            "review_title": "Review at Quan Com Pho",
            "review_text": "Rachel E\nSouth Fremantle, Australia31 contributions\n0\nLots of choice\nApr 2019 • Couples\nMy Hanoi-born friend recommended this place to me as a good representation of home-style cooking. Unfortunately my tdining partner wasn't hungry so I had to restrict my choice. I had tofu with spring onion and pork with salted duck eggs. Both were delicious. They happily provided me with takeaway boxes for my leftovers. Nice surrounding with very high ceilings. Free wifi too.\nThe waiters speak good English and the menu has pictures of the dishes with English descriptions.\nRead more\nWritten April 25, 2019",
